committer zichuanxu <zichuanxu28@gmail.com> 1790597835 +0900

Add seeded world generator, gold, kappa, shifts, probes and typed scoring

Script-first generator over six sources (email, calendar, tasks, contacts,
notes, messages) with object ids, monotone revisions and tombstones; gold
recomputed from source state; six versioned kappa definitions with
deterministic evaluators; S_src/S_def/S_cons shifts from separate random
streams; fidelity checker (100% on tested seeds); typed answer matching
without an LLM judge. Includes the stage 0.3 reuse evaluation.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
